    {
      "subId": "7301403",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the Aranara",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730140301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730140301": {
            "id": "730140301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Oh, it's a Nara. A golden and brave Nara...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140302"
            ]
          },
          "730140302": {
            "id": "730140302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey there! Paimon's Paimon and {F#she's}{M#he's} {NICKNAME}. Why're you here all alone? Everyone at Vanarana is busy preparing for Festival Utsava, y'know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140303"
            ]
          },
          "730140303": {
            "id": "730140303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arapandu has a very important task to do for Festival Utsava, for Apam Woods, and for Nara Varuna.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140304"
            ]
          },
          "730140304": {
            "id": "730140304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, that makes you Arapandu, then. But \"Nara Varuna\"? Hmm. That name sounds kinda familiar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140305"
            ]
          },
          "730140305": {
            "id": "730140305",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara Varuna... {M#She}{F#He} is a golden and brave Nara, just like Nara {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140306"
            ]
          },
          "730140306": {
            "id": "730140306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "When the moon and sun couldn't be seen, even the leaves of big trees in Vanarana were gnawed off by the wind, and their branches rotted away in the black rain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140307"
            ]
          },
          "730140307": {
            "id": "730140307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Vana's pain dripped into the soil. The smell of iron and salt was everywhere...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140308"
            ]
          },
          "730140308": {
            "id": "730140308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140309"
            ]
          },
          "730140309": {
            "id": "730140309",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "No one knows how many sunsets and sunrises passed before Nara Varuna came. A Golden Nara, who spoke a Golden language.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140310"
            ]
          },
          "730140310": {
            "id": "730140310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#{F#He}{M#She} and Aranara brought back the moon and the sun. The Varuna Contraption washed away Vanarana's pain. The black rain was gone and the smell of iron and salt was no more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140311"
            ]
          },
          "730140311": {
            "id": "730140311",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Everyone from Vanarana thanked and liked Nara Varuna who was like the sun, mud, and the dew drops.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140312"
            ]
          },
          "730140312": {
            "id": "730140312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Wow, that sounds amazing! {F#He}{M#She} must have been a good Nara!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140313"
            ]
          },
          "730140313": {
            "id": "730140313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hehe... But Nara {NICKNAME} has also helped lots of people, for which lots of people are thankful...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140314"
            ]
          },
          "730140314": {
            "id": "730140314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#You'll definitely like Nara {NICKNAME} as well, Arapandu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140315"
            ]
          },
          "730140315": {
            "id": "730140315",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140316"
            ]
          },
          "730140316": {
            "id": "730140316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#After {F#he}{M#she} left Vanarana, many were born from the soil and many returned to the soil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140317"
            ]
          },
          "730140317": {
            "id": "730140317",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Later, the branches and leaves of the Varuna Contraption grew weak. The Varunastra was like a scared finch and flapped its wings wildly. It then rained a lot. Very strange.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140318"
            ]
          },
          "730140318": {
            "id": "730140318",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Now running mushrooms have settled in Vana. Seeds that have never been seen before are everywhere...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140319"
            ]
          },
          "730140319": {
            "id": "730140319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Do you mean the Fungi and spores? Actually, that said, what are the Varuna Contraption and the Varunastra exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140320"
            ]
          },
          "730140320": {
            "id": "730140320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Could they be powerful weapons?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140322",
              "730140324"
            ]
          },
          "730140322": {
            "id": "730140322",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait! That would be too powerful!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140327"
            ]
          },
          "730140327": {
            "id": "730140327",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Hmm... No, not right. Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon both wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140328"
            ]
          },
          "730140328": {
            "id": "730140328",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Let's go to somewhere high above. Arapandu will tell you."
          },
          "730140324": {
            "id": "730140324",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What could they be then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140325"
            ]
          },
          "730140325": {
            "id": "730140325",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They could be winged Aranara made out of water...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730140326"
            ]
          },
          "730140326": {
            "id": "730140326",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wouldn't those just be Oceanid Mimics!?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301416",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the vantage spot with Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301417",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730141701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730141701": {
            "id": "730141701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! What's over there!? It's magnificent!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141702"
            ]
          },
          "730141702": {
            "id": "730141702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Now Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon know. That is the Varunastra. But the Varuna Contraption is in a deeper place, somewhere as deep as roots.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141703"
            ]
          },
          "730141703": {
            "id": "730141703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've underestimated Nara Varuna. Paimon didn't think it would be this big...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141704"
            ]
          },
          "730141704": {
            "id": "730141704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Such power is not to be underestimated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141705"
            ]
          },
          "730141705": {
            "id": "730141705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Before the black rain and before Nara Varuna came to Vana, Aramuhukunda and the Lord of Dendro created the Varuna Contraption. Rain gave life to many things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141706"
            ]
          },
          "730141706": {
            "id": "730141706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Black rain, black mud, and many other bad things made a mess of Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141707"
            ]
          },
          "730141707": {
            "id": "730141707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Before {F#he}{M#she} came, Arapandu had never seen such a brave Nara. {F#He}{M#She} fixed the machine together with Aranara, just like the sun driving away the sleepy fog.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141708"
            ]
          },
          "730141708": {
            "id": "730141708",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Nara Varuna is no longer in Vanarana. Aramuhukunda is no longer in Vanarana... But Aranara must fix the Varuna Contraption again for Festival Utsava and Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141709"
            ]
          },
          "730141709": {
            "id": "730141709",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We promised Araja and Arama to help prepare for Festival Utsava. As they say, the fire is bigger and stronger when more Nara help pick firewood, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141710"
            ]
          },
          "730141710": {
            "id": "730141710",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Eek!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141711"
            ]
          },
          "730141711": {
            "id": "730141711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um! No, no, Paimon meant that everything will go smoothly with more Nara helping out! Don't be afraid, it has nothing to do with fire! They're not related at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141712"
            ]
          },
          "730141712": {
            "id": "730141712",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Paimon, you've outsmarted yourself yet again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141713"
            ]
          },
          "730141713": {
            "id": "730141713",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aw, come on. We're here in Sumeru, you know? Paimon just wanted to show everyone that she knows lots of stuff too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141714"
            ]
          },
          "730141714": {
            "id": "730141714",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Arapandu not scared. Paimon has good heart, just like Nara {NICKNAME} and Nara Varuna. Paimon is friend of Aranara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141715"
            ]
          },
          "730141715": {
            "id": "730141715",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Aranakula, Arabalika, Arakunti, and Arapandu want to heal the Varuna Contraption, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141716"
            ]
          },
          "730141716": {
            "id": "730141716",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "There are too many spores and Fungi, so we can't do anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141717"
            ]
          },
          "730141717": {
            "id": "730141717",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arapandu doesn't have a powerful Ararakalari like Arabalika, and the strange rain made the Fungi fiercer...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141718"
            ]
          },
          "730141718": {
            "id": "730141718",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hold on. Ararakalari? Arana told Paimon that it can be used to repel Marana...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141719"
            ]
          },
          "730141719": {
            "id": "730141719",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Powerful Ararakalari can drive away Fungi. Arapandu's Ararakalari is weak. Can't do anything to Fungi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141720"
            ]
          },
          "730141720": {
            "id": "730141720",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? Ararakalari can be used that way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141721"
            ]
          },
          "730141721": {
            "id": "730141721",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ararakalari should be the general name for a certain type of ability...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141722"
            ]
          },
          "730141722": {
            "id": "730141722",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} is smarter than Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141723"
            ]
          },
          "730141723": {
            "id": "730141723",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141724"
            ]
          },
          "730141724": {
            "id": "730141724",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Different Aranara have different Ararakalari, but all Aranara gain the power to use it from the plants of Vana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141725"
            ]
          },
          "730141725": {
            "id": "730141725",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arabalika's Ararakalari is very powerful, not afraid of large Fungi and large iron Nara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141726"
            ]
          },
          "730141726": {
            "id": "730141726",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Large iron Nara?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141727"
            ]
          },
          "730141727": {
            "id": "730141727",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Large iron Nara are very big and have two arms and two legs like Nara {NICKNAME}, but only have one eye.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141728"
            ]
          },
          "730141728": {
            "id": "730141728",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, you're talking about Ruin Guards!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141729"
            ]
          },
          "730141729": {
            "id": "730141729",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Pretty clever, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141730"
            ]
          },
          "730141730": {
            "id": "730141730",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141731"
            ]
          },
          "730141731": {
            "id": "730141731",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Oh! There are Fungi on the trees over there... Arabalika can defeat them, but Arapandu can't...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141732"
            ]
          },
          "730141732": {
            "id": "730141732",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} not afraid of Fungi either. You do not use Ararakalari, but you are very powerful. Destroy them, like strong gust blowing away a leaf! Whoosh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141733"
            ]
          },
          "730141733": {
            "id": "730141733",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#If not dealt with, spores and Fungi will multiply... Nara {NICKNAME}...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141734"
            ]
          },
          "730141734": {
            "id": "730141734",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Leave them to us! Nara {NICKNAME} should be able to deal with them in an instant! Right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
