    {
      "subId": "7301410",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730141001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730141001": {
            "id": "730141001",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So this is the \"rest stop,\" huh? There are some signs that Aranara were here earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141002"
            ]
          },
          "730141002": {
            "id": "730141002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption looks even more impressive from here. Urgh... the pressure is so intense...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141003"
            ]
          },
          "730141003": {
            "id": "730141003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Paimon, watch out in case you get sucked in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141004"
            ]
          },
          "730141004": {
            "id": "730141004",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That won't happen! Paimon hopes...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141005"
            ]
          },
          "730141005": {
            "id": "730141005",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "We made an agreement. Will meet up at the \"rest stop\" after healing the Varuna Contraption's branches and leaves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141006"
            ]
          },
          "730141006": {
            "id": "730141006",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Then, we will banish the bad bugs gnawing on the Varuna Contraption's roots and heal it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141007"
            ]
          },
          "730141007": {
            "id": "730141007",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "By the way, what do you mean by \"the Varuna Contraption's branches and leaves\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141008"
            ]
          },
          "730141008": {
            "id": "730141008",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption's branches and leaves are everywhere in Vana. They give the machine power to turn black rain into good rain. Good rain then gives things life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141009"
            ]
          },
          "730141009": {
            "id": "730141009",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Like how rainwater flows into a stream and then into a lake, the branches and leaves gather bits and pieces that go into the Varuna Contraption.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141010"
            ]
          },
          "730141010": {
            "id": "730141010",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption is now no longer the same. It is like broken branches have blocked the rainwater, so streams can't form. Without streams, the lake dries out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141011"
            ]
          },
          "730141011": {
            "id": "730141011",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Urgh... Paimon still doesn't get it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141013",
              "730141018"
            ]
          },
          "730141013": {
            "id": "730141013",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! Paimon won't have strength to work if she doesn't eat! Does this mean the Varuna Contraption is hungry-angry?"
          },
          "730141018": {
            "id": "730141018",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then we need to clear all the roadblocks to keep going!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141019"
            ]
          },
          "730141019": {
            "id": "730141019",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We just need to find another path, then! Who decided that we have to take this route anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141020"
            ]
          },
          "730141020": {
            "id": "730141020",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, who decided this route?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301411",
      "subQuestName": "Find the \"branch\" and \"leaves\" with Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301412",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730141201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730141201": {
            "id": "730141201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... Paimon never thought that we'd find them in a place like this!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141202"
            ]
          },
          "730141202": {
            "id": "730141202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hold on... Eh? You sure these are \"branches and leaves\"? They look like...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141203"
            ]
          },
          "730141203": {
            "id": "730141203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Like stones placed by Aranara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141204"
            ]
          },
          "730141204": {
            "id": "730141204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Stone leaves, stone branches. They were created by Aramuhukunda and the Lord of Dendro and can channel Vanarana's power into the Varuna Contraption.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141205"
            ]
          },
          "730141205": {
            "id": "730141205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So the Varuna Contraption is like a big tree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141206"
            ]
          },
          "730141206": {
            "id": "730141206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, so that's how it is, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141207"
            ]
          },
          "730141207": {
            "id": "730141207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Hmm... Oh no. The three leaves need to be turned to face the branch, but Arapandu is not strong enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141208"
            ]
          },
          "730141208": {
            "id": "730141208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Well, you Aranara are kinda small. Don't worry, just leave this to Nara {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141209"
            ]
          },
          "730141209": {
            "id": "730141209",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arabalika might be able to do it, but Aranakula and Arakunti...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141210"
            ]
          },
          "730141210": {
            "id": "730141210",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Still, we need to solve this problem first. Nara {NICKNAME}, Arapandu will leave it to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301413",
      "subQuestName": "Make the three \"leaves\" turn towards the \"branch\"",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730141301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730141301": {
            "id": "730141301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Just turn all three leaves to face the branch. Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301415",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730141501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730141501": {
            "id": "730141501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME}. Leave the rest to Arapandu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141502"
            ]
          },
          "730141502": {
            "id": "730141502",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "But it has been too long. Don't know if it will work this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141503"
            ]
          },
          "730141503": {
            "id": "730141503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What!? There's a chance it can fail?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141504"
            ]
          },
          "730141504": {
            "id": "730141504",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "It worked before, but this time it may or may not work. Just like how the sun rose last time and the time before that, but nobody knows if it will rise the next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141505"
            ]
          },
          "730141505": {
            "id": "730141505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Only after the sun rises next time can Paimon say: \"Oh, the sun has risen again.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141506"
            ]
          },
          "730141506": {
            "id": "730141506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, wait, that's not good! What if the sun never rises again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141507"
            ]
          },
          "730141507": {
            "id": "730141507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Paimon, there's no need to be afraid. Nara {NICKNAME} is golden like the sun, just like Nara Varuna. A brave Nara, Nara {NICKNAME} is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141508"
            ]
          },
          "730141508": {
            "id": "730141508",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara Varuna returned the moon and sun to us. Nara {NICKNAME} can also do that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141509"
            ]
          },
          "730141509": {
            "id": "730141509",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...Yes! Paimon also believes in {NICKNAME}. {F#She}{M#He} can overcome any difficulty!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141510"
            ]
          },
          "730141510": {
            "id": "730141510",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't you worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141511"
            ]
          },
          "730141511": {
            "id": "730141511",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "But for now, leave this to Arapandu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141512"
            ]
          },
          "730141512": {
            "id": "730141512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon thinks it... worked?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141513"
            ]
          },
          "730141513": {
            "id": "730141513",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Yes, the branch and leaves here are healed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141514"
            ]
          },
          "730141514": {
            "id": "730141514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's great! And your Aranara dance was really interesting, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141515"
            ]
          },
          "730141515": {
            "id": "730141515",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You could learn some fancy footwork from the Aranara, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141516"
            ]
          },
          "730141516": {
            "id": "730141516",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds like a great idea!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141517"
            ]
          },
          "730141517": {
            "id": "730141517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I mean, more exercise will be good for you, given how much you eat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141518"
            ]
          },
          "730141518": {
            "id": "730141518",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hey! Paimon's been running around everywhere with you, {NICKNAME}. That counts as exercise!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141519"
            ]
          },
          "730141519": {
            "id": "730141519",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, this won't be enough to fix the Varuna Contraption, will it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141520"
            ]
          },
          "730141520": {
            "id": "730141520",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "There are three more places like this in Vana. Arabalika is very strong and might succeed... But Arapandu's very worried about Aranakula and Arakunti. Vana has become more dangerous after the strange rain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141521"
            ]
          },
          "730141521": {
            "id": "730141521",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What say we help you go check on them, then? After all, we can't prepare for Festival Utsava in peace if the Varuna Contraption isn't fixed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141522"
            ]
          },
          "730141522": {
            "id": "730141522",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#With the help of Paimon and Nara {NICKNAME}, the Varuna Contraption will surely be fixed soon. Life will return to Vana like before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141523"
            ]
          },
          "730141523": {
            "id": "730141523",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Aranakula went to the <color=#00E1FFFF>Yasna Monument</color>. There is an Aranara memorial to Nara Varuna in the depths of Vana, but we haven't been there for a long time because of the Fungi and spores.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141524"
            ]
          },
          "730141524": {
            "id": "730141524",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Aranakula is used to being with soil and seeds. Familiar with all things born from the soil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141525"
            ]
          },
          "730141525": {
            "id": "730141525",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Find him. Tell him Arapandu's name. Then he will not be afraid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141526"
            ]
          },
          "730141526": {
            "id": "730141526",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh? He sounds like a rather timid Aranara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141527"
            ]
          },
          "730141527": {
            "id": "730141527",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Arabalika's Ararakalari is very strong! But... But please, Paimon and Nara {NICKNAME}, go check on him...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141528"
            ]
          },
          "730141528": {
            "id": "730141528",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Arabalika is at the <color=#00E1FFFF>Ruins of Dahri</color>. That place smells like iron so much... Paimon and Nara {NICKNAME} must be careful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141529"
            ]
          },
          "730141529": {
            "id": "730141529",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We will, thanks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141530"
            ]
          },
          "730141530": {
            "id": "730141530",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arakunti is at the <color=#00E1FFFF>Grove of Dreams</color>. You can enter dreams from there. He and Nara have a... distant relationship. If he hides, play our music.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141531"
            ]
          },
          "730141531": {
            "id": "730141531",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of that, didn't we get an Aranara music score earlier? We can try playing that if we can't find Arakunti.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141532"
            ]
          },
          "730141532": {
            "id": "730141532",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Arapandu will wait at the \"rest stop\" and observe how Vana is doing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141533"
            ]
          },
          "730141533": {
            "id": "730141533",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Aranakula, Arabalika, and Arakunti know to meet up at the \"rest stop\" after healing the branches and leaves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141534"
            ]
          },
          "730141534": {
            "id": "730141534",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Golden Nara, brave Nara. May Aramuhukunda watch over Nara {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730141535"
            ]
          },
          "730141535": {
            "id": "730141535",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup! You can count on us!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}